# OPERATOR STATE. `make pi-ship` does not overwrite the copy on the Pi
# (PI_OWNED in the Makefile). git holds only the seed for a fresh
# install. Edit on the Pi: `sudo pf tui`, Agent lists, then apply.
#
# Agent segments only. The house has house_direct_ip.allow. Addresses or
# CIDRs that an agent may connect to on 443 when the Pi resolver did not
# give them first. Empty means that the address of each HTTPS origin
# server must come from a DNS answer. That closes curl --resolve and
# /etc/hosts as a way around the domain lists. Nothing on an agent
# segment needed an entry here. The use case is a service that gives
# addresses through its own API, not DNS, and that is not agent traffic.
